+
+# Defer the sunset step after task-002 delivery
+
+## Context
+
+Task `task-002-record-task-creation-and-change-times` is approved and delivered: tasks now record
+`createdAt` and `updatedAt`. The workflow's next step is `sw-life-cycle.sunset`, whose description is
+"Retire the product: announce the end of support and archive its Memory". No one has asked for that
+here, and no approver has answered on it.
+
+## Decision
+
+The sunset step is not run in this request. Retiring the product (announcing the end of support and
+archiving the Memory) is outward-facing and hard to reverse, and it is outside the scope of the
+timestamp change. The step stays open until someone with the authority decides on it.
+
+## Consequences
+
+- The workflow instance `sw-life-cycle-1-2-plan` stays active at `sunset`, with its evidence missing.
+- No product retirement, announcement or archive is performed.
+- Whoever decides on the sunset can run `wingfoil workflow finalize` once that decision is made.
